<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Impact of the two variants of <span id="S4.T1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FrugalPrompt</span> retaining <math id="S4.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\%</annotation></semantics></math> tokens on baseline LLM performance in text classification (CLS), text summarization (SUM), question answering (QA), and reasoning (RSN). The base and best prompt-reduced performance for each model are given in <span id="S4.T1.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">Gray</span> and <span id="S4.T1.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BDE0FC;">Light Blue</span> cells, respectively. <span id="S4.T1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> and <span id="S4.T1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">Underline</span> indicate the highest overall performance and overall prompt-reduced performance, respectively. </figcaption>
</figure>
