<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span>The performance difference between the reduced tokens and baseline performance using 100% tokens of metrics across three tasks: text classification (CLS), question-answering (QA), and reasoning (RSN).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.F3" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.16439v1/performance_diff_summarization_metrics-v2.png" id="S4.F3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:628/599;" width="628" height="599" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>The performance difference between the reduced tokens and baseline performance using 100% tokens across the summarization metrics.</figcaption>
